cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the reference paper below."
title: "5g_ansible: Automated multi-stack 5G deployment and monitoring with Ansible"
abstract: >-
  Ansible framework to deploy and monitor sliced private 5G networks on Kubernetes,
  unifying the configuration of the OAI, Open5GS and free5GC cores, the OAI and
  srsRAN RAN, and the UERANSIM simulator, for scenarios on the R2Lab / SophiaNode
  testbed with real 5G devices and RAN simulation (OAI RFsim, UERANSIM).
